Grammar

    0 $accept: file $end

    1 file: lines

    2 lines: lines line
    3      | ε

    4 line: line separator value
    5     | value


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    value <vstring> (258) 4 5
    separator (259) 4


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (5)
        on left: 0
    file (6)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    lines <varray> (7)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 1 2
    line <varray> (8)
        on left: 4 5
        on right: 2 4


State 0

    0 $accept: • file $end

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (lines)

    file   go to state 1
    lines  go to state 2


State 1

    0 $accept: file • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 3


State 2

    1 file: lines •
    2 lines: lines • line

    value  shift, and go to state 4

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (file)

    line  go to state 5


State 3

    0 $accept: file $end •

    $default  accept


State 4

    5 line: value •

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (line)


State 5

    2 lines: lines line •
    4 line: line • separator value

    separator  shift, and go to state 6

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (lines)


State 6

    4 line: line separator • value

    value  shift, and go to state 7


State 7

    4 line: line separator value •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (line)
